const initialSettings={presets:[{id:'A',title:'GT Ultra',ui:'GT Standard L'},{id:'B',title:'Literata',ui:'GT Standard L'},{id:'C',title:'GT Standard L',ui:'GT Standard L'}],body:'Literata',number:'GT Ultra',brand:'GT Ultra',titleScale:1};const settingsFile=path.join(root,'TypographySettings.json');if(!fs.existsSync(settingsFile))fs.writeFileSync(settingsFile,JSON.stringify(initialSettings,null,2));const settings=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(settingsFile));
